    "details": "<p>A creative software challenge where teams build <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">quirky, unusual, and entertaining software</span> rather than traditional corporate tools. Participants must combine <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">unconventional UX, technical absurdity, and creative engineering</span> to build prototypes that surprise, amuse, and captivate the jury.</p>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Teams must consist of <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">1 to 4 members</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Software must focus on <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">entertainment, absurdity, and quirky creativity</span> rather than enterprise utilities.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">All code must be authored within the 3<span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">-hour official hack window</span>; open-source libraries may be leveraged but core logic must be fresh.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Any tech stack is allowed: <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">Web, Mobile, CLI, IoT, Browser Extensions, or Game Engines</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Judging criteria: <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">Creativity (40%), Execution (30%), Entertainment &amp; Demo (30%)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">Round 1: Rapid 3-Hour Prototyping Sprint\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sand/80 pl-3\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">The secret thematic creative constraints are revealed at the <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">opening bell</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Teams have exactly 4 hours to build and push their prototype to a <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">public repository</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"space-y-3\">Round 2: Live Stage Jury Demonstration\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sand/80 pl-3\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">A 5-minute live demo on stage where teams demonstrate their <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">working quirky software</span> to the jury.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Followed by a quick <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">2-minute interactive Q&amp;A session</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>",
